  "difficulty_reason": "The proof constructs an initial square-zero thickening for every formally unramified ring map, without finite-generation assumptions, by splitting the infinite free polynomial cotangent module and correcting all polynomial-generator lifts uniquely through the inverse conormal differential. This explicit universal obstruction-killing construction goes beyond ordinary uniqueness of infinitesimal lifts.",
